
## Frontend (Vite + plain CSS)

```bash
npm install
npm run dev      # Vite HMR during development
npm run build    # emit into public/build
```

No CSS framework: `resources/css/app.css` is yours to write. The welcome view
links both entry points with `@vite`, which points at the dev server while
`npm run dev` is running and at the built files afterwards.
